WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.224 --> 00:00:04.080
And again, Maxxine Dupri up on the apron,

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.580
paying dividends here.

3
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.489
Oh, big Bronson Reed, the Auszilla.

4
00:00:09.489 --> 00:00:12.270
I was wonderin' where he was at.

5
00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:15.570
And oh my God.
Death Valley Driver.

6
00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:18.330
Jagged Edge on the floor from Reed.

7
00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.707
There goes Evans.

8
00:00:19.707 --> 00:00:20.732
(crowd cheering and yelling)

9
00:00:20.732 --> 00:00:24.810
The massive Bronson Reed makin' his presence felt,

10
00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.582
thanks to the distraction by Maxxine.

11
00:00:27.582 --> 00:00:30.332
(crowd cheering)

12
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.323
And paid homage.

13
00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.453
Cover my theory to retain.
(fist banging)

14
00:00:39.453 --> 00:00:44.215
Penta kept out. What?
(crowd cheering)

15
00:00:44.215 --> 00:00:45.695
Breakker can't believe it.

16
00:00:45.695 --> 00:00:47.240
Theory can't believe it.

17
00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.483
(crowd cheering)

18
00:00:49.483 --> 00:00:52.233
(dramatic music)

19
00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:55.958
(crowd chanting)

20
00:01:02.473 --> 00:01:05.223
(crowd cheering)

21
00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:14.515
(dramatic music)
(crowd chanting)

22
00:01:24.012 --> 00:01:26.063
(wrestler shouting)

23
00:01:26.063 --> 00:01:29.721
Penta and Je'Von have some backup.

24
00:01:29.721 --> 00:01:33.213
The King of the Ring, the ruler.

25
00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:36.123
Oba Femi is here.

26
00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:40.020
We are about to have another clash

27
00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:42.030
