34
00:02:00.721 --> 00:02:02.723
(crowd cheering and chanting)

35
00:02:02.723 --> 00:02:03.930
Oh-no, no, no, no.

36
00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.070
Oh my God.

37
00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.890
Shuck putting Reed off the stage

38
00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.966
and through all that equipment.

39
00:02:09.966 --> 00:02:12.240
(Femi breathing heavily)

40
00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:14.943
That's one way to neutralize the Auszilla.

